        "BIO": "Dr. Duong (Young) received his Ph.D. in Civil Engineering in 2024 from South Dakota School of Mines & Technology (SDSMT). He is a licensed engineer with consulting experience in structural engineering, geotechnical engineering, and concrete materials.<br><br>Dr. Duong’s research focuses on sustainable and alternative concrete materials, including coal ashes and geopolymer binders. His teaching interests and experience consist mostly of structural engineering and structural materials courses.<br><br>In his spare time, he enjoys playing guitar, lifting weights, painting, and collecting and drawing comic books.",
